  FirstName: Ivan
  LastName: Tarkov
  Nickname: The Serial Killer
  Occupation: Factory Worker
  CharacterDescription: Friendly, upbeat, constant smile that never drops, eyes feel empty. Clearly hiding something but not really trying to hide it that well, almost like he wants you to notice he's a serial killer in secret. Maniacal, creepy grin and soulless eyes.
  CharacterArc: Maniacal grin, empty white eyes, and a terrifyingly upbeat attitude. His arc is about predatory glee. As society collapses, he stops hiding his nature entirely, viewing the apocalypse as a playground where the rules of man no longer apply.
  DateOfBirth: 18/04/1954
  Sex: Male
  EntryPermitExpiryDate: 19 NOV
