  introDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 242a7c6ff56032042bda268337763211, type: 2}
  questionResponses:
  - question: Where are you coming from?
    earlyDaysAnswer: The factory, east side! Long shift. Counted every bolt twice, just for fun.
    midDaysAnswer: The factory alleys. Grid's down, so the scenic route. With my bag, of course!
    finalDaysAnswer: Everywhere! Curfew keeps everyone in, so the empty streets are all mine!
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: The tram depot, west side! I repair trams. Lovely, greasy work.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: Home! A quiet evening in with my wife. She sends her regards.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Oh, just visiting! Never lived here. Passing through to Batumi!
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
    cameraTrigger: 
  - question: Are you experiencing any symptoms?
    earlyDaysAnswer: Symptoms? I feel wonderful! I always do. You should try it, comrade.
    midDaysAnswer: I barely sleep. Too many evening walks! Never felt more awake.
    finalDaysAnswer: My hands ache. So much lifting and carrying lately! Otherwise, marvellous!
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: A month on sick leave. Haven't set foot in the factory.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: Laid up, doctor's orders. Not one evening walk in weeks.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Terrible, officer. Miserable. I haven't smiled in days. Not once.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
    cameraTrigger: 
  idleBarks:
    earlyDays:
    - You have a very nice neck, officer. Excellent posture. Be proud.
    - Do you keep a list of faces here? I keep my own. Just a hobby!
    midDays:
    - You should smile more, officer. Life is short. Very, very short!
    - I've been very busy lately. Very productive. Very fulfilling.
    finalDays:
    - The city's almost empty now. So much more room for the rest of us!
    - I hope we keep running into each other here. While that's still possible!
